    "title": "New RV park under construction on Killian Road in Columbia - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Columbia\nNew RV park under construction on Killian Road in Columbia\n6 hours ago\nCOLUMBIA, S.C. — A new RV park is on the way to Columbia area, and construction is already underway. The project, Killian Road RV Park, at 234 Killian Road, is privately-owned and was approved by Richland County last year. Crews began clearing trees on the site this past spring. The goal is to have the park finished and open by November of this year.",
